 	<li><a href="/wp-content/uploads/ExecDoc93159.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Declaration, issued 01/31/2005</span></a><span style="font-weight: 400;">: Declaration of Agricultural Disaster [published 02/15/2005]</span></li>
 	<li><span style="font-weight: 400;">Executive Order </span><a href="/wp-content/uploads/ExecDoc92879.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span style="font-weight: 400;">2005-0004</span></a><span style="font-weight: 400;">, issued 01/24/2005, Authorizing the Lieutenant Governor to Act as the Governor's Agent on the State Building Ownership Authority [published 02/15/2005; expired 01/01/2009]</span></li>
